Package: PLSKO
Type: Package
Title: Robust knockoff variable generator for biological omics data
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Guannan Yang
Maintainer: Guannan Yang <guannany@student.unimelb.edu.au>
Description: Knockoff is a framework to control FDR in variable selection by incorporating any model. This package include the function to implement PLSKO and PLS-AKO to generate robust knockoff variables and other functions in the knockoff framework.
